      "filename": "Carbon Nanotube Device (27946537789).png",
      "title": "File:Carbon Nanotube Device (27946537789).png",
      "url": "https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/5/5d/Carbon_Nanotube_Device_%2827946537789%29.png",
